+
+A small, account-free reading tracker. Add a book with a title, author, and optional notes; mark it finished when you're done. Open any book to view its details and copy its direct link to share.
+
+## Run
+
+Requires Node.js 20 or newer. No database, build step, or external packages are needed.
+
+"'```sh
+npm start
+```
+
+Open `http://localhost:3000`. For automatic restarts during development, use `npm run dev`.
+
+Books are saved to `data/books.json` after each change. You can set `PORT` to change the port or `BOOKS_FILE` to choose a different JSON file. Keep the file somewhere writable and back it up if you want to preserve your shelf. Anyone with access to the app can see and change its books; it is intended for personal use on a trusted network.
